{"product_id":"vaporesso-itank-m","title":"Vaporesso iTank M","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Vaporesso iTank M is a compact 3ml vape tank is easy to maintain and uses coils that are push-fit, meaning there's less mess. The adjustable airflow allows you to set how tight or loose you want the inhale to feel. The 1.2 Ohm MTX coil that's included with the tank will create an MTL (Mouth To Lung) inhale with a discreet amount of vapour. The iTank M is compatible with any mod that use a 510 connection.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3ml Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMTL Inhale\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Filling Tank\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable Airflow\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible With MTX Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePair With 50% Or Higher PG \u003ca title=\"E Liquids Kenya\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/vape-liquid\"\u003eE-Liquids\u003c\/a\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis tank is top filling, so you don't even have to take it off the mod to refill when it's empty, just push and twist the top cap to reveal the e-liquid inlet. The MTX 1.2 Ohm coil is best used between 8 - 12W, which creates an inhale that feels similar to a cigarette. As an MTL tank, the iTank M works well with e-liquids that are have a 50% PG concentration or a high PG blend.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eContains:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVaporesso iTank M \u003ca title=\"Vape Tank\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/vape-tanks\"\u003eVape Tank\u003c\/a\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.2 Ohm Vaporesso MTX Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUser Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41775207383095,"sku":"V iTank M","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso-itank-m-box-min.jpg?v=1752511684","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-itank-m","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




